  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Sistema de Proteccin Social</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Social Protection System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los dos objetivos del programa son: (i) aliviar la pobreza a corto plazo y (ii) promover la acumulacin de capital humano de los pobres como medio de reducir la pobreza a largo plazo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s twin objectives are to alleviate short-term poverty and promote the accumulation of human capital by the poor as a means to reduce long-term poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
